@host = http://localhost:5600
@mock = http://localhost:6150

### Wyslij maila przez CommunicationService (-> MockSendGrid)
POST {{host}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipentEmail": "klient@example.com",
  "title": "Twoje zgloszenie zostalo przyjete",
  "content": "Dziekujemy za kontakt. Numer sprawy: TKT-2024-001",
  "timestamp": "2026-01-27T12:00:00Z",
  "isRead": false
}

### Mock admin - stats
GET {{mock}}/admin/stats

### Mock admin - reset
POST {{mock}}/admin/reset

### Mock admin - invalidate token
POST {{mock}}/admin/invalidate-token
